content:
The status "confirmed" never appears in the orders table at all — only "fulfilled", "invoiced", and "paid". The violated rows in E9 all have order_status="paid", and there are no ERROR logs in payment-service (E10). The deploy at t=506 refactored webhook error handling and its timing fits. The most coherent explanation: the v1.1 deploy changed the status written to orders on payment capture from "confirmed" to "paid", so the invariant (which expects "confirmed") is permanently broken for every payment captured after t=506.

